+- [ ] **Step 3: Implementiere**
+  - `TodoStore.cs`: `public record TodoPatch(string? Title, bool? Done, DateOnly? DueDate, [property: System.Text.Json.Serialization.JsonIgnore] bool DueDateSet);` – Achtung: `JsonIgnore` auf einem Record-Property: `[property: JsonIgnore]`.
+  - `Update`: `todo = todo with { Title = title ?? todo.Title, Done = patch.Done ?? todo.Done, DueDate = patch.DueDateSet ? patch.DueDate : todo.DueDate };`
